 a modern duplex penthouse for sale in Estepona West next to Estepona Golf and Alcazaba Lagoon. This stylish home offers 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 165 m² of built space. Enjoy sea, golf and mountain views from spacious terraces and a private rooftop terrace. The gated community features a large swimming pool, gym, private parking and a storage room. The property is also just minutes from the beach, shops and local amenities.\n\nInside you will find a bright open plan living area with a modern kitchen and direct access to the terrace. The upper level leads to a stunning rooftop terrace that is perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The apartment is presented in excellent condition and offers a practical layout with generous indoor and outdoor living spaces.\n\nPenthouse Laguna is an excellent choice for a permanent home, holiday property or investment on the Costa ‌del ‌Sol. ‌Its ‌prime ‌location, ‌modern design ‌and outstanding ‌community facilities make it a ‌property ‌that ‌serious ‌buyers ‌should not miss. Contact ‌us ‌today ‌to ‌arrange ‌your ‌private ‌viewing."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Suroeste","Excelente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Mar","Montaña","Golf","Campo","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Trastero","Sin Amueblar","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Comunitario","Golf","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South West","Excellent","Communal","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","Sea","Mountain","Golf","Country","Panoramic","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Gym","Storage Room","Not Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Gated Complex","Communal","Golf","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}